streaming IN CNAME neoprism
flix IN CNAME neoprism
flex IN CNAME neoprism
flux IN CNAME neoprism
flax IN CNAME neoprism
flox IN CNAME neoprism
mergebot IN CNAME neoprism
cdio IN CNAME neoprism
c IN CNAME neoprism
hass IN CNAME neoprism
grafana IN CNAME neoprism
hermes IN CNAME neoprism
assist IN CNAME neoprism
vault IN CNAME neoprism
cal IN CNAME neoprism
kanban IN CNAME neoprism
n2n IN CNAME neoprism
id IN CNAME neoprism
byoidc IN CNAME neoprism
where.is IN CNAME neoprism
parley IN CNAME neoprism
review IN CNAME neoprism
*.review IN CNAME neoprism
;; DNS-01 for the *.review wildcard cert, dynamic zone in knot.nix
_acme-challenge.review IN NS ns1
pds IN CNAME neoprism
*.pds IN CNAME neoprism
;; DNS-01 for the *.pds wildcard cert (PDS handles), dynamic zone in knot.nix
_acme-challenge.pds IN NS ns1
git IN CNAME neoprism
knot IN CNAME neoprism
mirror IN CNAME neoprism
when IN CNAME neoprism
paperless IN CNAME neoprism
nixcontalks IN CNAME neoprism

;; Mail
@ IN MX 3 mail
mail IN A 95.217.192.59
mail IN AAAA 2a01:4f9:4a:4f1a::2
imap IN A 95.217.192.59
imap IN AAAA 2a01:4f9:4a:4f1a::2
smtp._tls IN TXT "v=TLSRPTv1;rua=mailto:postmaster@lassul.us"
;
mail._domainkey IN TXT ( "v=DKIM1; k=rsa; "
	"p=MIIBIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOCAQ8AMIIBCgKCAQEAuGBSOPqq6EsTMZSiIrawNgUh3lM3K4jduEYIxmmp72s62Yp3Pcc3pYVCjMnhd9mhZG2bpPtoiyyy1oac5htdUoifz2OwHDinWLJZ+cxa+R2tPi7cfRW1ou7b/CzmsN4o96iCPtux2GVtVTk1EQZoOkFC/+/s7lO481qCId0g0j6tIos4W4D6qS6Dz5q1IQra4avRPxDmVDaVvLHzY"
	"LGl/siLTLxgjbw42eh7rqCAdUI6uOD0T04mAQiV4lO7bJNqdc0xsrleMUhwAiTnkmzXBpmNzG+x8vKgzH6kgByN1nSqCjZHtDpFNZcJOvvdXNlO1ezk+vm7azQHqjbWXWt2GQIDAQAB"
